  "description": "A versatile track bike to hammer the velodrome planks or take on the frenzied urban race scene. If you don’t fancy that then fit the supplied brakes and take on the urban jungle.\n\nInspired by Six Day racing and the Red Hook crit series, the Six is built to race. The frame is constructed from double butted 6061 T6 aluminium tubes, and all aluminium fork with tapered steerer and 45mm rake. Reinforced dropouts and built in chain tug’s keep the rear wheel supported in the most demanding situations.\n\nTrack inspired geometry – tight and fast, with a raised BB giving the perfect blend of stability, and the ability to react quickly with confidence in tight situations.\n\nSleek internal rear brake cable routing, with supplied blanking plates to cover the holes if you are brake-less, give the Six a clean look and maximise aerodynamics. The Six comes fitted as standard with both front and rear brakes with cross-top levers.\n\nThe wheels are true all-rounders, featuring 43mm deep track rims, with added machined braking surface and flip-flop hub so you can choose to ride fixed single-speed or with a freewheel.\n\nBuilt to go all out whatever your surface.",
